sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Pegawai as "Pegawai"
    participant View as "Web View (employee.attendance.index)"
    participant Controller as "Employee AttendanceController"
    participant Model as "Attendance Model"
    participant DB as "Database"

    Pegawai->>View: Buka menu Absensi Saya
    View->>Controller: GET /employee/attendance
    Controller->>Model: Build filter (periode, status, search)
    Model->>DB: SELECT attendance by worker + relasi pendukung
    DB-->>Model: Data absensi + metadata
    Model-->>Controller: Koleksi absensi terfilter

    alt Data valid (data berhasil diambil)
        Controller->>View: Render riwayat, ringkasan, tombol aksi
        View-->>Pegawai: Daftar absensi saya tampil
    else Data tidak valid (worker/data tidak ditemukan atau error)
        Controller->>View: Redirect dashboard/back + error
        View-->>Pegawai: Notifikasi gagal memuat absensi
    end
